cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this MCP server, please cite it using this metadata. Existing credit
  is retained; added contributor entries are alphabetically serialized for
  identification, not an agreed citation priority or fine-grained role assignment.
type: software
title: EFFIS Fire Detection MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for European wildfire analysis. It retrieves burnt area polygons
  from the European Forest Fire Information System (EFFIS) and computes
  Sentinel-2 NDVI and BAIS2 time series around fire events through the
  Copernicus Data Space Ecosystem. It also provides current mapped exposure,
  regional weather and modeled concentration context, explicit-proxy emissions
  screening, and a bounded monthly MODIS aggregate fallback. These outputs do
  not establish damage, fire-specific smoke causation or worldwide coverage.
